<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>We Received Your Message - Blue Sky</title>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f7f9; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #222021;">
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="padding: 30px 0; background-color: #f4f7f9;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table width="700" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
          style="background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" bgcolor="#055a90" style="padding: 25px 20px;">
              <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Blue Sky</h1>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Content -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 30px 40px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;">
              <p style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #055a90; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                We Received Your Message
              </p>

              <p><strong>Dear <%= full_name %>,</strong></p>

              <p>Thank you for contacting Blue Sky. We have received your message and will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>

              <table width="100%" cellpadding="15" cellspacing="0"
                style="background-color: #eef6fb; border-left: 4px solid #055a90; border-radius: 4px; margin: 20px 0;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="font-size: 15px;">
                    <p><strong>Subject:</strong> <%= message_subject %></p>
                    <p><strong>Submitted on:</strong> <%= submitted_at %></p>
                    <p style="margin-top: 10px;"><strong>Your message:</strong></p>
                    <p><%= message %></p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p>If you have any urgent questions in the meantime, you can reach us at the contact details on our website.</p>

              <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Best regards,<br /><strong>Blue Sky Team</strong></p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center" bgcolor="#055a90" style="color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; font-size: 14px;">
              &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Blue Sky Organisation. All rights reserved.
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>

</html>
